# Art direction lock

All visuals for this project use **Asphalt-Comic** (style option 1) only.

When generating images, mockups, assets, VFX, UI art, HUD/menu look, CSS that defines the look, or style prompts:

1. **Read** and follow `.cursor/skills/asphalt-comic-art/SKILL.md`
2. Use `.cursor/skills/asphalt-comic-art/reference.png` as the canonical look
3. Do not use diorama, night-neon, poster, or low-poly styles unless the user explicitly requests a one-off exception
